  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TGNP 2008-2012 - EXTERNAL EVALUATION</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TGNP 2008-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den strategiska planen f&#xf6;r Tanzania Gender Networking Program (TGNP)  syftar till att st&#xe4;rka organisationens feministiska och lokalt        grundade r&#xf6;relse som utmanar patriarkat och oj&#xe4;mlika f&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden p&#xe5;  alla niv&#xe5;er, och som verkar f&#xf6;r kvinnors egenmakt samt social         transformering och r&#xe4;ttvisa i Tanzania.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tanzania Gender Networking programme (TGNP) strategic plan aims   to contribute to the building of a vibrant transformative feminist    movement that is capable of challenging patriarchy and neo-liberalism at all levels, grounded locally and advocating for gender             equality/equity, women&apos;s empowerment, social justice and social       transformation in TZ and beyond.</narrative>
  </description>
